            Pre-register your laptop, bicycle, headphones, and keys with secure serial hashes. If lost, trigger an instant campus broadcast in a single click.
          </p>
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-4">
<a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-secondary px-8 py-3.5 font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-secondary shadow-lg shadow-secondary/30 transition-all hover:bg-secondary-container hover:text-on-secondary-container active:scale-95" data-path="report-lost" href="#">
