<h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface tracking-tight">Browse Lost &amp; Found Directory</h1>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl">Real-time database of reported items across campus and partner public zones with verified claim integrity.</p>
