caps text-label-caps text-on-surface uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Campus &amp; Security</p><ul class="space-y-3 font-body-sm text-body-sm"><li><a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">Security Partner Portal</a></li><li><a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">Custody Transfer Protocol</a></li><li><a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">Campus Security Dispatch</a></li><li><a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">Verification Badges</a></li><li><a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">Community Guidelines</a></li></ul></div><div><p class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Legal &amp; Trust</p><ul class="space-y-3 font-body-sm text-body-sm"><li><a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">Terms of Custody</a></li><li><a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">Trust &amp; Safety Standards</a></li><li><a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">Law Enforcement Request</a></li><li><a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">Security Vulnerability</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"><p>© 2025 Lost Link Technologies Inc. All rights reserved.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-6 font-label-md text-label-md"><a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" data-path="login" href="#">Auth &amp; Login</a><a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">System Status</a><a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">Cookie Preferences</a></div></div></div></footer></body></html>

<!-- Report Found Item - Lost Link -->
<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/><meta content="web_standard" name="shell-type"/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect"/><link crossorigin="" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect"/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/><style>@layer base{html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}body{overscroll-behavior:none;}main>:first-child{margin-top:0!important;}main>:last-child{margin-bottom:0!important;}}::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}</style><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script><script id="tailwind-config">tailwind.config={darkMode:"class",theme:{extend:{colors:{"on-tertiary":"#ffffff","on-primary":"#ffffff","outline":"#76777d","surface-bright":"#f8f9ff","outline-variant":"#c6c6cd","inverse-primary":"#bec6e0","surface-tint":"#565e74","on-background":"#0b1c30","surface-dim":"#cbdbf5","tertiary-fixed-dim":"#4edea3","error":"#ba1a1a","primary-fixed-dim":"#bec6e0","on-tertiary-fixed-variant":"#005236","surface-container-lowest":"#ffffff","tertiary":"#000000","on-surface":"#0b1c30","surface":"#f8f9ff","surface-container-high":"#dce9ff","surface-container":"#e5eeff","inverse-surface":"#213145","secondary-container":"#5bb8fe","tertiary-fixed":"#6ffbbe","on-primary-container":"#7c839b","on-secondary-fixed-variant":"#004b73","secondary":"#006398","primary-fixed":"#dae2fd","on-primary-fixed-variant":"#3f465c","primary-container":"#131b2e","surface-container-low":"#eff4ff","secondary-fixed":"#cce5ff","on-tertiary-fixed":"#002113","primary":"#000000","error-container":"#ffdad6","tertiary-container":"#002113","inverse-on-surface":"#eaf1ff","on-error-container":"#93000a","on-secondary-fixed":"#001d31","surface-variant":"#d3e4fe","on-surface-variant":"#45464d","on-secondary":"#ffffff","on-secondary-container":"#00476e","on-error":"#ffffff","secondary-fixed-dim":"#93ccff","on-primary-fixed":"#131b2e","on-tertiary-container":"#009668","surface-container-highest":"#d3e4fe","background":"#f8f9ff"},borderRadius:{DEFAULT:"0.25rem",lg:"0.5rem",xl:"0.75rem",full:"9999px"},spacing:{"space-sm":"0.5rem","margin-mobile":"1rem","space-md":"1rem",gutter:"1.5rem",margin:"2rem","space-lg":"1.5rem","space-xs":"0.25rem","space-xl":"2.5rem","gutter-mobile":"1rem"},fontFamily:{"headline-lg-mobile":["Plus Jakarta Sans"],"headline-sm":["Plus Jakarta Sans"],"label-lg":["Inter"],"label-caps":["Inter"],"headline-md":["Plus Jakarta Sans"],"label-md":["Inter"],"body-lg":["Inter"],"body-sm":["Inter"],display:["Plus Jakarta Sans"],"headline-lg":["Plus Jakarta Sans"],"body-md":["Inter"]},fontSize:{"headline-lg-mobile":["1.75rem",{lineHeight:"2.25rem",letterSpacing:"-0.02em",fontWeight:"700"}],"headline-sm":["1.25rem",{lineHeight:"1.75rem",letterSpacing:"-0.01em",fontWeight:"600"}],"label-lg":["0.875rem",{lineHeight:"1.25rem",letterSpacing:"0.01em",fontWeight:"600"}],"label-caps":["0.6875rem",{lineHeight:"0.875rem",letterSpacing:"0.06em",fontWeight:"700"}],"headline-md":["1.5rem",{lineHeight:"2rem",letterSpacing:"-0.015em",fontWeight:"600"}],"label-md":["0.75rem",{lineHeight:"1rem",letterSpacing:"0.02em",fontWeight:"600"}],"body-lg":["1.125rem",{lineHeight:"1.75rem",fontWeight:"400"}],"body-sm":["0.875rem",{lineHeight:"1.25rem",fontWeight:"400"}],display:["3.5rem",{lineHeight:"4rem",letterSpacing:"-0.03em",fontWeight:"800"}],"headline-lg":["2.25rem",{lineHeight:"2.75rem",letterSpacing:"-0.02em",fontWeight:"700"}],"body-md":["1rem",{lineHeight:"1.5rem",fontWeight:"400"}]}}}}</script></head><body class="bg-surface font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface antialiased"><header class="fixed top-0 left-0 w-full z-50 bg-surface-container-lowest/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-outline-variant/30 shadow-[0_1px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)]"><div class="bg-surface-container-low/70 border-b border-outline-variant/20 px-4 py-1.5"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between font-label-md text-label-md"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed-dim ring-4 ring-tertiary-fixed/30"></span><span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Community Live Network</span><span class="text-outline-variant">•</span><span class="text-on-surface-variant">98.4% verified match confidence rate across 42 active campuses</span></div><div class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-4 text-on-surface-variant"><span class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-secondary">verified_user</span> Instant Owner Verification</span><a class="text-secondary hover:text-on-secondary-container transition-colors" data-path="search" href="#">View real-time feed →</a></div></div></div><div class="h-16 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-8"><a class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0 group" data-path="home" href="#"><img alt="Lost Link Logo" class="h-8 w-auto object-contain" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/ALJJyrAWkuYliyQSJANRbojEO-eUUWgyAcLcHTK2--plMIchupuR3pZIDpC6_3MBxU-wFd3VQaPAH8C70WC5-9qiyDPdwjLym2mjQ6JuheG-qSpwg0S3Ww49hsjkYgniXstMt9UQklivfrH8eaprzVxd5Qd3uEg1O3rlV-HADiDWggYqmHh0HCQuYOwJKZqWjadissjaDuFU-k-tGYSVJwLF7rfkVkzMrwCRzW9uhR6PeoavQg"/><span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary tracking-tight">Lost<span class="text-secondary">Link</span></span></a><nav class="hidden lg:flex items-center gap-1" data-active-classes="bg-surface-container text-on-surface font-bold rounded-lg shadow-sm"><a class="px-3 py-2 rounded-lg font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-all" data-path="home" href="#">Home</a><a class="px-3 py-2 rounded-lg font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-all" data-path="search" href="#">Search Items</a><a class="px-3 py-2 rounded-lg font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-all" data-path="report-lost" href="#">Report Lost</a><a aria-current="page" class="px-3 py-2 transition-all bg-surface-container text-on-surface font-bold rounded-lg shadow-sm" data-path="report-found" href="#">Report Found</a><a class="px-3 py-2 rounded-lg font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-all" data-path="details" href="#">Item Details</a><a class="px-3 py-2 rounded-lg font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-all" data-path="dashboard" href="#">Dashboard</a></nav></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><a class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg rounded-xl hover:bg-primary-container hover:text-on-primary transition-all shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] active:scale-95" data-path="report-lost" href="#"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">add_circle</span><span>Report Item</span></a><button aria-label="Notifications" class="relative p-2 rounded-xl text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">notifications</span><span class="absolute top-1.5 right-1.5 flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-secondary ring-2 ring-surface-container-lowest"></span></button><div class="h-6 w-px bg-outline-variant/40 hidden sm:block"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 pl-1"><a class="flex items-center gap-2.5 p-1 rounded-full hover:ring-2 hover:ring-secondary/30 transition-all" data-path="dashboard" href="#"><img alt="Profile" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover ring-1 ring-outline-variant/40" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDjMfrt-WEROSs2iJonvDsI4X3dqr0syl44qQp3LwwHfIlcSGQMOl4GS0KC7vT6SOnT8dhMVBJDJp8YmS-0NjjCTqyL_RU4ygw-wUK2I8Pm8eBwffKabEqxJZ0xBa1pbx3oDlwVeoD6BJ-YSsclUL0rvsDqO6E1oLG0pSZLxOGechPHnHrFTTRTI3q4ZE_yGdwq7naecv_TVwhMVzO7nPNA1BpB0KGUSWYGYq3he3LN"/><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-on-surface-variant hidden md:block">expand_more</span></a></div></div></div></header><main class="w-full pt-24 bg-surface min-h-screen"><div class="flex flex-col w-full">
<!-- Top Ambient Glow Decorator -->
<div class="relative w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 sm:py-12">
<div class="absolute top-0 left-1/3 w-96 h-96 bg-secondary/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
<div class="absolute top-20 right-10 w-80 h-80 bg-tertiary-fixed/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
<!-- Header Block -->
<header class="mb-10 text-left max-w-3xl">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface text-label-md font-label-md mb-4 shadow-sm">
<span class="text-base leading-none">🤝</span>
<span class="font-semibold">Thank you for being an honest finder!</span>
<span class="inline-block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary"></span>
<span class="text-secondary font-medium">Earn +50 Karma Points</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface tracking-tight mb-3">
        Report a Found Item
      </h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
        Help someone recover their valuable. Submitting takes less than a minute, and you can securely hand it over to a verified campus drop-off hub.
      </p>
</header>
<!-- Main Grid Layout (Split Form + Trust Sidebar) -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
<!-- Primary Form Area (8 cols on desktop) -->
<form class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-8" id="found-report-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); triggerSubmitFeedback();">
<!-- SECTION 1: WHAT DID YOU FIND? -->
<section class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 pb-3">
<span class="flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-headline-sm text-headline-sm">1</span>
<div>
<h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">What did you find?</h2>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Core item characteristics to trigger immediate AI similarity matching</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="space-y-6">
<!-- Item Name / Title -->
<div>
<label class="block font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface mb-2" for="item-title">
                Item Title or Short Name <span class="text-error">*</span>
</label>
<div class="relative">
<input class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md placeholder:text-outline focus:outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-secondary transition-all" id="item-title" placeholder="e.g. Dark Brown Leather Bifold Wallet with ID" required="" type="text" value="Found: Dark Brown Leather Bifold Wallet"/>
<span class="absolute right-3.5 top-3.5 text-on-surface-variant material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">badge</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Category & Brand Dual Column -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
<div>
<label class="block font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface mb-2" for="item-category">
                  Category <span class="text-error">*</span>
</label>
<div class="relative">
<select class="w-full appearance-none px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-secondary transition-all pr-10" id="item-category" required="">
<option selected="" value="wallets">Wallets &amp; Purses</option>
<option value="electronics">Electronics &amp; Laptops</option>
<option value="keys">Keys &amp; Fobs</option>
<option value="ids">IDs, Badges &amp; Cards</option>
<option value="backpacks">Backpacks &amp; Bags</option>
<option value="clothing">Jackets &amp; Apparel</option>
<option value="other">Other Unique Item</option>
</select>
<span class="absolute right-3.5 top-3.5 pointer-events-none text-on-surface-variant material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">expand_more</span>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<label class="block font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface mb-2" for="item-brand">
                  Brand or Distinct Markings
                </label>
<input class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md placeholder:text-outline focus:outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-secondary transition-all" id="item-brand" placeholder="e.g. Fossil embossed on inner fold" type="text" value="Fossil embossed emblem on bottom right"/>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Condition Pills -->
<div>
<label class="block font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface mb-2">Physical Condition</label>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2.5" id="condition-group">
<button class="condition-chip py-2.5 px-3 rounded-lg text-center font-label-md text-label-md bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container transition-all" onclick="selectCondition(this)" type="button">
                  Pristine / Like New
                </button>
<button class="condition-chip py-2.5 px-3 rounded-lg text-center font-label-md text-label-md bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-bold shadow-sm transition-all" onclick="selectCondition(this)" type="button">
                  Lightly Used
                </button>
<button class="condition-chip py-2.5 px-3 rounded-lg text-center font-label-md text-label-md bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container transition-all" onclick="selectCondition(this)" type="button">
                  Noticeably Worn
                </button>
<button class="condition-chip py-2.5 px-3 rounded-lg text-center font-label-md text-label-md bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container transition-all" onclick="selectCondition(this)" type="button">
                  Damaged / Scratched
                </button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- SECTION 2: DESCRIPTION & BLIND VERIFICATION -->
<section class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 pb-3">
<span class="flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-headline-sm text-headline-sm">2</span>
<div>
<h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Description &amp; Verification Secret</h2>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Protect private details while setting up an ironclad ownership test</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="space-y-6">
<!-- Public Description -->
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
<label class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface" for="public-desc">
                  Public Description <span class="text-error">*</span>
</label>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Visible to all searchers</span>
</div>
<textarea class="w-full p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md placeholder:text-outline focus:outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-secondary transition-all resize-y" id="public-desc" placeholder="Give visible exterior details like color, fabric, stickers, or strap length..." required="" rows="3">Found a men's dark brown leather wallet. Clean condition, holds several commuter cards and university registration. Found placed on a wooden bench.</textarea>
<div class="mt-2.5 flex items-start gap-2 text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary shrink-0">shield</span>
<p><strong class="font-medium text-on-surface">Privacy Notice:</strong> Please never write down card numbers, full driver license ID digits, or home addresses. Our staff and systems auto-verify those via secure matching.</p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Blind Verification Question (Special High-Trust Prompt) -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-5">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] text-secondary">lock_open</span>
<label class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface" for="blind-question">
                  Blind Ownership Question (Secret Verification)
                </label>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-3">
                Craft a private question only the real owner could accurately answer. The answer stays hidden from other visitors.
              </p>
<input class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md placeholder:text-outline focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-secondary transition-all shadow-sm" id="blind-question" placeholder="e.g. What photo or membership card is visible behind the mesh divider?" type="text" value="What color transit card is tucked behind the driver's license?"/>
<div class="mt-3">
<label class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-1 block" for="blind-answer">Expected Answer (Stored encrypted for match verification)</label>
<input class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md placeholder:text-outline focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-secondary transition-all shadow-sm text-sm" id="blind-answer" placeholder="e.g. Cyan Blue MetroPass" type="text" value="Cyan Blue MetroPass with orange lanyard clip"/>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- SECTION 3: WHERE AND WHEN WAS IT FOUND? -->
