ed text-[20px]">home</span><span>Public Site</span></a></nav></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-outline-variant/30 pt-4 px-2"><div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><img alt="Profile" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDjMfrt-WEROSs2iJonvDsI4X3dqr0syl44qQp3LwwHfIlcSGQMOl4GS0KC7vT6SOnT8dhMVBJDJp8YmS-0NjjCTqyL_RU4ygw-wUK2I8Pm8eBwffKabEqxJZ0xBa1pbx3oDlwVeoD6BJ-YSsclUL0rvsDqO6E1oLG0pSZLxOGechPHnHrFTTRTI3q4ZE_yGdwq7naecv_TVwhMVzO7nPNA1BpB0KGUSWYGYq3he3LN"/><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface leading-tight">Security Desk</span><span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary">Verified Partner</span></div></div><a aria-label="Sign out" class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-error transition-colors" data-path="login" href="#"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">logout</span></a></div></div></aside><div class="pl-64"><header class="fixed top-0 left-64 right-0 h-16 bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-outline-variant/30 z-40 flex items-center justify-between px-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-surface-container-low px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/30 text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">hub</span><span>Node: Central Campus Recovery</span></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-secondary text-on-secondary font-label-lg text-label-lg rounded-xl hover:bg-on-secondary-container transition-all shadow-sm" data-path="report-found" href="#"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">add</span><span>Register Intake</span></a><button aria-label="Dashboard Notifications" class="relative p-2 rounded-xl text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">notifications</span><span class="absolute top-1.5 right-1.5 flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-secondary"></span></button><img alt="Profile" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover ring-1 ring-outline-variant/40" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDjMfrt-WEROSs2iJonvDsI4X3dqr0syl44qQp3LwwHfIlcSGQMOl4GS0KC7vT6SOnT8dhMVBJDJp8YmS-0NjjCTqyL_RU4ygw-wUK2I8Pm8eBwffKabEqxJZ0xBa1pbx3oDlwVeoD6BJ-YSsclUL0rvsDqO6E1oLG0pSZLxOGechPHnHrFTTRTI3q4ZE_yGdwq7naecv_TVwhMVzO7nPNA1BpB0KGUSWYGYq3he3LN"/></div></header><main class="w-full pt-16 bg-surface min-h-screen px-8 py-8"><div class="flex flex-col w-full gap-8">
<!-- Top Welcome Bar with Asymmetrical Accent Backing -->
<section class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 shadow-sm">
<div class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-secondary-container/20 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between gap-6">
<div class="space-y-2 max-w-2xl">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-secondary font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-wider">
<span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary animate-ping"></span>
          Campus Radar Operational • Live Syncing
        </div>
<h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface tracking-tight">
          Welcome back, Maya! <span class="inline-block hover:rotate-12 transition-transform cursor-default">👋</span>
</h1>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          Manage your active lost reports, found items, automated match alerts, and community recovery score across all campus nodes.
        </p>
</div>
<!-- Quick Action CTAs -->
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
<a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.01] active:scale-[0.99] transition-all" data-path="report-lost" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">search_off</span>
<span>+ Report Lost Item</span>
</a>
<a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-secondary text-on-secondary font-label-lg text-label-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.01] active:scale-[0.99] transition-all" data-path="report-found" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">inventory_2</span>
<span>+ Report Found Item</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- 4-Column KPI Stats Grid -->
<section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
<!-- Card 1: Active Lost Reports -->
<div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div class="flex items-start justify-between">
<div class="space-y-1">
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-on-surface-variant tracking-wider">Active Lost Reports</span>
<div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
<span class="font-display text-display text-on-surface leading-none">2</span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-error flex items-center">
<span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-error mr-1.5 animate-pulse"></span>
              On Radar
            </span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">radar</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-4 pt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md">
<span class="flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">wifi_tethering</span>
<span>3 Nodes Pinging</span>
</span>
<span class="font-semibold text-secondary hover:underline cursor-pointer">View feed →</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 2: Items Reunited -->
<div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div class="flex items-start justify-between">
<div class="space-y-1">
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-on-surface-variant tracking-wider">Items Reunited</span>
<div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
<span class="font-display text-display text-on-surface leading-none">3</span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-secondary-container bg-surface-container-high px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-semibold">100% Success</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-high text-secondary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">military_tech</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-4 pt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md">
<span>Last: HydroFlask 32oz</span>
<span class="text-on-surface font-medium">Oct 19</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 3: Potential AI Matches -->
<div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div class="flex items-start justify-between">
<div class="space-y-1">
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-secondary tracking-wider font-bold">Potential AI Matches</span>
<div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
<span class="font-display text-display text-secondary leading-none">4</span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-secondary-fixed-variant bg-secondary-fixed px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold">New Detected</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-secondary text-on-secondary shadow-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">auto_awesome</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-4 pt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md">
<span class="font-semibold">Requires confirmation</span>
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-bold">Review Now →</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 4: Community Karma / Trust Score -->
<div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div class="flex items-start justify-between">
<div class="space-y-1">
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-on-surface-variant tracking-wider">Community Karma</span>
<div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
<span class="font-display text-display text-on-surface leading-none">780</span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant">pts</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Circular mini gauge -->
<div class="relative w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center">
<svg class="w-full h-full -rotate-90" viewbox="0 0 36 36">
<path class="text-surface-container-high" d="M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.5"></path>
<path class="text-secondary" d="M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-dasharray="88, 100" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="3.5"></path>
</svg>
<span class="absolute font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary font-bold">88%</span>
</div>
