</span>
</div>
<div class="space-y-2 pt-2 text-on-surface font-body-sm text-body-sm">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md">Status Badge</span>
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold text-secondary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">verified</span>
              Verified Student ID
            </span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md">Campus Node ID</span>
<span class="font-mono text-on-surface font-semibold">STU-99420-CS</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md">Institutional Email</span>
<span class="text-on-surface">m***a@campus.edu</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md">Phone (Encrypted)</span>
<span class="text-on-surface">+1 (555) •••-8821</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="pt-2 flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant uppercase">Recovery Reputation</span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md font-bold text-secondary">99.4% Authenticity</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Live Custody Pickup Active Reminders -->
<div class="rounded-xl bg-surface-container-high p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="flex items-start justify-between">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">lock_clock</span>
<h4 class="font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold">Secure Pickup Reserved</h4>
</div>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-secondary text-on-secondary font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase font-bold">Active</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface">
          Your validated item is secured in automated custody locker at Central Campus Security Pavilion.
        </p>
<!-- Custody code box -->
<div class="rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2">
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-on-surface-variant">Automated Locker PIN</span>
<div class="font-display text-headline-lg tracking-widest text-on-surface font-mono font-bold">
            8 4 9 2
          </div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-error font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">timer</span>
<span>Expires in 47 hrs 12 mins</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">storefront</span>
<span>Locker Bay #14 • West Pavilion Arcade</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">contactless</span>
<span>Tap student ID card or enter 4-digit PIN</span>
</div>
</div>
<button class="w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-secondary text-on-secondary font-label-lg text-label-lg hover:bg-on-secondary-container transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">directions</span>
<span>Get Walking Directions</span>
</button>
</div>
<!-- Recent System Activity Log -->
<div class="rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">System Activity</h4>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-on-surface-variant">Live stream</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-3 font-body-sm text-body-sm">
<!-- Item 1 -->
<div class="flex items-start gap-3">
<div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary mt-2"></div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="text-on-surface font-medium">Neural match generated (98%)</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md">AirPods Pro matched with Security Desk intake</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant text-[11px]">14 mins ago</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Item 2 -->
<div class="flex items-start gap-3">
<div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-outline-variant mt-2"></div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="text-on-surface font-medium">Security Officer checked custody tag</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md">Intake tag #SEC-491 verified at Central Hub</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant text-[11px]">1 hour ago</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Item 3 -->
<div class="flex items-start gap-3">
<div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-outline-variant mt-2"></div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="text-on-surface font-medium">Karma points awarded (+50 pts)</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md">Calculator returned to Hall B Student Union</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant text-[11px]">Yesterday</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<a class="pt-2 text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold hover:underline flex items-center gap-1" href="#">
<span>View complete audit trail</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">chevron_right</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div></main></div></body></html>

<!-- Login & Sign Up - Lost Link -->
<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/><meta content="web_blank" name="shell-type"/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect"/><link href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect"/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
